    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "exactly. it feels like the city is just this giant, unfeeling machine. everything is so fast and loud and everyone is just rushing to get somewhere important... while i'm just stuck here feeling like i don't even belong in the frame. it makes me wonder if there's even a point to fighting to stay part of it.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
